First, conﬁgure an ISM policy in OpenSearch Dashboards.
1.
From your domain dashboard in the OpenSearch Service console, navigate to the OpenSearch
Dashboards URL and sign in with your master username and password. The URL follows this
format: domain-endpoint/_dashboards/.
2.
In OpenSearch Dashboards, choose Add sample data and add one or more of the sample
indexes to your domain.
3.
Open the left navigation panel and choose Index Management, then choose Create policy.
4.
Name the policy ism-policy-example.
5.
Replace the default policy with the following policy:
{
"policy": {
"description": "Move indexes between storage tiers",
"default_state": "hot",
"states": [
{
"name": "hot",
"actions": [],
"transitions": [
{
"state_name": "snapshot",
"conditions": {
